    `The haircut in the reference is a "${hairstyle.name}" — ${unpunctuated(hairstyle.description)}. ` +
    'Give the person this haircut as the reference shows it, including where that means cutting, ' +
    'removing or reshaping the hair they currently have: the hair on their head must visibly change.'
